tasks.description:
**Goal:** Two new RPM-only packages in root/ppg/common/deps/ that build only on UBI_10 and publish RHEL 10's perl-JSON 4.10 and lapack 3.12.0.

**Files:**
- Create: root/ppg/common/deps/perl-JSON-4.10/{package.yaml,obs/_service,rpm/perl-JSON.spec}
- Create: root/ppg/common/deps/lapack-3.12/{package.yaml,obs/_service,rpm/lapack.spec,+Stream 10 Source files}

**Acceptance Criteria:** see plan Task 8 (Stream 10 specs, Release 1%{?dist}, bare Source filenames, Percona changelog entry, sha512 check, 13-repo build map, project verify clean, black/pyright/pytest).

**Verify:** `for d in perl-JSON-4.10 lapack-3.12; do ls root/ppg/common/deps/$d root/ppg/common/deps/$d/obs root/ppg/common/deps/$d/rpm; grep -m1 '^Release:' root/ppg/common/deps/$d/rpm/*.spec; done`

```json:metadata
